e protagonist of the story, a transfer student at an all-girls school, Ginran Academy. He used to be a member of a choir when he was young, but now a boy who gets excited when holding a sword. As a result of refining his fencing skill in order to look \"cool,\" he is made to dress up like a girl and assigned as an \"Assistant Instructor in Chivalry.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124651"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"乙女の園・銀蘭学園に編入する本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃は合唱団に所属していたこともあるが、いまは剣を握るとわくわくしてしまう男の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「格好いい」を目指して剣の腕を磨いた結果、『騎士道指南役補佐代理』として女装することに。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24594","sourceWorkId":"34119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"乙女の園・銀蘭学園に編入する本作の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃は合唱団に所属していたこともあるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いまは剣を握るとわくわくしてしまう男の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「格好いい」を目指して剣の腕を磨いた結果、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『騎士道指南役補佐代理』として女装することに。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126991"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b2d57772e70dc6c9525eb8742811e7875560c946813641a63313df807bc394e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5fb4ad6d053fe4206c61dfee87a5f9a5b1a4685f1b1de587f28c88938d7233d2.webp","width":89,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村麻未","creatorId":"vndb:s980","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s980","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s980","name":"中村 麻未","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:424882:126991:15637:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c124652","characterName":"小柴 杏奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"126992","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"424882"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24595"],"vndbCharacterId":"c124652"},"originalCharacterName":"小柴 杏奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"823"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"It's the privilege of being a neighbor.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hinata's childhood friend and former neighbor. They became separated after Anna had to move away. Without realizing Hina's true identity, she and him are seated next to each other in the class, becoming neighbors again."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124652"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"日向とは家が隣同士の幼馴染みだったが、杏奈の引っ越しを機にずっと疎遠だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陽菜の正体が日向であるとは気付かないまま、教室の席が隣同士となり、再びお隣さんに。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24595","sourceWorkId":"34119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"日向とは家が隣同士の幼馴染みだったが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"杏奈の引っ越しを機にずっと疎遠だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陽菜の正体が日向であるとは気付かないまま、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教室の席が隣同士となり、再びお隣さんに。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126992"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7fd09abc6ee88f0908af9938974c8cf692be086587c97a0d7250eff423a629df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9734ad811a351093f7925c81ecdcd023ca390baefa3c0028db637d630210e2a.webp","width":98,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林桂子","creatorId":"vndb:s443","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s443","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s443","name":"美月(声優)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:424882:126992:16180:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"円 志乃","creatorId":"vndb:s4190","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4190","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4190","name":"円 志乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94769","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c124653","characterName":"天海 依夜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"126994","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"424882"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24596"],"vndbCharacterId":"c124653"},"originalCharacterName":"天海 依夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1104"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"If you don't mind, next time, let's practice together...... No, coaching, could you?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student in the Knight Training Department, possessing an unparalleled strength. For two consecutive years, she is chosen as the \"Best Knight: Brillante,\" and is admired by the maidens attending Ginran Academy. She rarely shows emotion in her expressions, words, or actions, but on the inside, she is full of emotions and overflows with compassion."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124653"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"比類なき強さを誇る、騎士育成科３年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"２年連続{最優秀騎士:ブリランテ}に選ばれた、銀蘭学園に通う乙女たちの憧れ的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動や表情に感情が出ることは少ないが、内面は情緒豊かで、思いやりに溢れている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24596","sourceWorkId":"34119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"比類なき強さを誇る、騎士育成科３年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"２年連続{最優秀騎士:ブリランテ}に選ばれた、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"銀蘭学園に通う乙女たちの憧れ的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言動や表情に感情が出ることは少ないが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内面は情緒豊かで、思いやりに溢れている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126994"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f919a9decacd60d1ae9f4e54fd1b0fa4071573c6d98e0f41b38fc8f3a3a15194.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f6a7e72bfac0441147f52719ea6bf24cb0204f59fc2d21a518fe2ad5a6ecd17.webp","width":104,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風鈴みすず","creatorId":"vndb:s12799","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12799","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12799","name":"日向 結希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:424882:126994:26471:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c124654","characterName":"クレール・メルル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"126993","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"424882"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24597"],"vndbCharacterId":"c124654"},"originalCharacterName":"クレール・メルル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1221"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Together with us, let's do club activities, shall we?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An exchange student from France and a third-year student in the Lady Training Department. She likes to take care of others and being close to everyone, often hugs them as a form of skinship. Giving off a relaxed vibe while being shrewd, she is a caring and kind older sister, but also relatively clumsy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124654"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"才媛育成科３年で学ぶ、フランス人留学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世話好きな性格で誰に対しても距離感が近く、スキンシップと称して抱きついてくることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほわっとした雰囲気ながら抜け目なく、気を配る優しいお姉さんなのにわりとドジっ子。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24597","sourceWorkId":"34119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"才媛育成科３年で学ぶ、フランス人留学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世話好きな性格で誰に対しても距離感が近く、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スキンシップと称して抱きついてくることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ほわっとした雰囲気ながら抜け目なく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気を配る優しいお姉さんなのにわりとドジっ子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126993"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/1594130b90d3d8bca3daa125c0729060eaf16e4c941e2a76b953c46b9cb7eb01.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f97ddad4ae7097e12d49e9ebc49398b53d091a05fd46b0551a95e9a03fa4ee9c.webp","width":89,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松山紗香","creatorId":"vndb:s904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s904","name":"松山 紗香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:424882:126993:10662:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c124655","characterName":"椋木 梨理","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"126995","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"424882"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24598"],"vndbCharacterId":"c124655"},"originalCharacterName":"椋木 梨理","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"318"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Then, it's fine to call you sensei, isn't it? Right? Hina-sensei.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A well-rounded first-year student in the Knight Training Department. Influenced by her older sister, she started to learn fencing at an early age, and becomes unmatched among the first-year students. She calls the assistant instructor Hina, \"Sensei,\" while keeping a certain distance and gets involved with him moderately​."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124655"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道、成績優秀な騎士育成科１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉の影響で幼い頃からフェンシングを修め、１年生では並ぶ者なしの実力者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"指南役補佐代理である陽菜を「センセ」と呼び、一定の距離を保ちつつも、ほどよく絡んでくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24598","sourceWorkId":"34119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道、成績優秀な騎士育成科１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉の影響で幼い頃からフェンシングを修め、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"１年生では並ぶ者なしの実力者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"指南役補佐代理である陽菜を「センセ」と呼び、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一定の距離を保ちつつも、ほどよく絡んでくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126995"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/3249972f33600836c8b14675f0e7c53998791609be11c2a972fde63febc866c8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/72b69b2436626ff32ef12a6847e64773433d28e3511975115c7572398fd9c2ee.webp","width":75,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"益子優衣","creatorId":"vndb:s25620","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25620","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25620","name":"益子 優衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:424882:126995:49384:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124984","characterName":"宮守 睦月","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124984"},"originalCharacterName":"宮守 睦月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"122"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"After all, it's very pretty, that's why.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A friendly and pretty second-year student in the Lady Training Department. She is named the \"Diva of Ginran\" due to her singing ability, very talented to the point that Nina, who is a former diva, gives her approval. However, frankly, she does not seem to accept it. Her private life is full of mysteries and she seems to have a certain big secret."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It is revealed later in the story that Mutsuki is actually a boy, who has been cross-dressing since an early age due to family circumstances, but he fully accepted it. He is also Hinata's first crush and childhood friend."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124984"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f9e03b320b0d78714e44c8e0e32b03f8ddc89e098b2dd7ab97700a7834bc69e1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0a768962c90c919bd0d747eb3f9ac3071fbead3ce2f30439100554c6ab662325.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"月野 きいろ","creatorId":"vndb:s1545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1545","name":"さいとう よしえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94768","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124985","characterName":"椋木 美実","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124985"},"originalCharacterName":"椋木 美実","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"606"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Because they are always infinite, the potentials of a maiden.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The president of the Maiden Club and a third-year student in the Knight Training Department. She has excellent communication skills and can get along with anyone. Also a talented knight, she is the perfect rival for Iyo. She likes to play pranks, especially on her beloved younger sister Lili, often teasing her and then patting her afterwards."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124985"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d451d4d89297fe6abcb500c618aa2a9c1d95f3a3d808eb371e37865da3caeb6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1beee7da3a5bf4b19811ff136c24872a895e4202ce9b70ca2d74ce30bba54095.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加々美 澪","creatorId":"vndb:s17936","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17936","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17936","name":"加々美澪","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94772","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124986","characterName":"ニナ・クリオーネ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124986"},"originalCharacterName":"ニナ・クリオーネ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"503"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Fufufu, that's right. If this was a video game, then she'd be the last boss.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The principal and chairwoman of Ginran Academy, who is adored by the students. She attended Arianrhod Girls' Academy in Europe. During her time as a student there, she was named a diva. Nina is the creator of \"Cadenza,\" a new kind of fencing using stereoscopic images, along with various equipment and facilities to accommodate it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124986"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f790b1430e71b73e74917ef0d6481087b27cc7385373fa9e8f6c60d26ee1507e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f9f801fac48ee4d52d89a017db548378bdd7bf43507e6298120ae6c64f1365c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"今谷 皆美","creatorId":"vndb:s648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s648","name":"今谷 皆美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94770","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124987","characterName":"諏訪 宗千佳","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124987"},"originalCharacterName":"諏訪 宗千佳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"504"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"From the looks of it, you've learned well.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Well-trusted by the students, she is the instructor in Chivalry at Ginran Academy. When she was young, she studied abroad at Arianrhod Girls' Academy, and was chosen as the best knight \"Brillante\" because of her talent. She has known Nina since their days at the school. Suwa is Hina's cousin and also his fencing teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124987"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1